# AROMA-001 — THE BLACKWELL UNIVERSE AROMA LINE — FOUNDING PACKAGE

© C. MATTHEW BLACKWELL — INDEPENDENT DESIGNER

Foundation: built on the designated Blackwell Sigma-Pi Principle (EQS-318): every mass carries two prices - Sigma, the state price that runs, and Pi, the entropy price that never runs. The line is the principle, worn.

Insignia: a ring split in two halves - deep state navy and radiant pearl - meeting at a single bright point: the crossover. The numerals 663.22 are the line's second mark, engraved wherever the two halves meet.

Typography: BLACKWELL in engraved serif capitals; product names in clean geometric sans; the regime word (STATE / ENTROPY / CROSSOVER) set small under each name.

Identity baked in: every bottle's back label carries (1) the (c) C. MATTHEW BLACKWELL - INDEPENDENT DESIGNER line, (2) its own formula's record payload hash - the formula on file, verifiable, exactly as in his findings.

On the face: design package only - nothing manufactured, nothing blended; scent performance NOT MEASURED. Formulas are design drafts at today's perfumery craft; production requires a licensed compounder and an IFRA compliance pass on every formula.

## Palette
- **SIGMA:** Deep State Navy #0A1F3C, iron grey, black amber
- **PI:** Radiant Pearl #F4EFE6, starlight gold, nebula blush
- **CROSSOVER 663:** both palettes in one object, split at the seam
- **UNIVERSE MIST:** frosted glass over the epoch gradient - dawn frost, drift gold, destiny ember

## Bottle direction
- **SIGMA:** heavy rectangular flacon, matte deep-navy glass, thick base, brushed-iron cap; the Sigma glyph engraved, no paper label on the face.
- **PI:** rounded luminous flacon, opalescent pearl glass that catches light, gold collar; the Pi glyph engraved.
- **CROSSOVER 663:** the flagship object: one flacon split vertically - half deep navy, half pearl - fused at a bright seam down the center; 663.22 engraved across the seam.
- **UNIVERSE MIST:** tall fine-mist spray, frosted glass, epoch numeral large (0.44 / 2.74 / 6.70).

